san Lumpur Lapindo, Sun City Waterpark</span> dengan metode experiential learning yang teruji.</p></div></section></article><section class=\"py-20 md:py-32 bg-white relative overflow-hidden\" id=\"trust-section\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-12\"><div class=\"text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-16 md:mb-24\" style=\"width:auto;opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-4 py-1.5 transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 w-fit bg-red-50 text-red-600 mb-4\">E-E-A-T &amp; Proven Track Record</div><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-[#0A1628] leading-[1.15]\">Mengapa Perusahaan Mempercayakan Program Program di Sidoarjo pada <!-- --> <span class=\"text-[#EF4444]\">Growth Indonesia?</span></h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-lg text-slate-600 font-medium\">Kami bukan sekadar Event Organizer. Kami adalah mitra strategis untuk akselerasi budaya kerja, peningkatan kapasitas kolaborasi, dan regenerasi kepemimpinan.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-20 md:mb-32\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 p-8 rounded-3xl hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-red-500/5 transition-all duration-300\" style=\"width:auto;opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-red-50 text-[#EF4444] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award w-7 h-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-black font-display text-[#0A1628] mb-4\">Standardisasi BNSP</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Seluruh fasilitator dan instruktur lapangan kami tersertifikasi resmi secara nasional oleh Badan Nasional Sertifikasi Profesi.</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 p-8 rounded-3xl hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-red-500/5 transition-all duration-300\" style=\"width:auto;opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-red-50 text-[#EF4444] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check w-7 h-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-black font-display text-[#0A1628] mb-4\">Zero Accident Policy</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Prioritas tertinggi kami adalah keselamatan. Setiap kegiatan dilengkapi Risk Management Plan dan Standard Operating Procedure (SOP) keamanan sekala industri.</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 p-8 rounded-3xl hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-red-500/5 transition-all duration-300\" style=\"width:auto;opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-red-50 text-[#EF4444] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-video w-7 h-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 13 5.223 3.482a.5.5 0 0 0 .777-.416V7.87a.5.5 0 0 0-.752-.432L16 10.5\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"6\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-black font-display text-[#0A1628] mb-4\">Modern Documentation</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Paket yang ditawarkan mencakup tim media profesional dengan peralatan lengkap mulai dari Drone, Mirrorless, hingga produksi video cinematic.</p></div></div><div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto relative\" style=\"width:auto;opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"text-center mb-10\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-2xl md:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-[#0A1628]\">Perbandingan Value &amp; Kualitas</h3></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-xl shadow-slate-200/50 overflow-hidden relative z-10\"><div class=\"hidden md:block\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-12 bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200 p-6\"><div class=\"col-span-4 font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider text-sm\">Aspek / Kriteria</div><div class=\"col-span-4 font-black text-[#0A1628] text-lg text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">Growth Indonesia <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-5 h-5 text-[#EF4444]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"col-span-4 font-bold text-slate-500 text-lg text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">Provider Lain <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-x w-5 h-5 text-slate-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m15 9-6 6